  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the new 3.8.1-beta.1 SDK, a bunch of accessors have been added to allow for far-clip and culling distances to be applied at runtime to the main camera, and hand-held camera. \n\nI feel like it would also be a good idea to add these same accessors to the portable mirror to allow for some nice optimisations, and privacy related functionality. \n\nAlso I believe the portable mirror doesn't fully respect the far clipping plane set by the main camera currently so being able to set it via udon would be good.",
